{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1306 is a third-person story game where you play as a reactor maintenance bot labeled 1306, tasked with keeping the power plant from exploding. In this beginning chapter, it's up to 1306 to fix the reactor and prevent a total meltdown! However, they quickly learn that the task is more of a challenge than they initially thought... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915860/extras/1306Waving.gif?t=1745532073\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The reactor is somehow drained and missing all three coolant rods. It's up to you to retrieve the rods from the warehouse and place them in the reactor's base before it can be filled back up!</strong> <br><br> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915860/extras/SLMDIalogGIF.gif?t=1745532073\" />  <br> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915860/extras/RODINSERT.gif?t=1745532073\" />  <br><strong> </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Journey down to the warehouse to collect the rods!</strong><br> <br> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915860/extras/ElevatorRide.gif?t=1745532073\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>With the help of your trusty wrench, get the lights on!</strong> <br>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915860/extras/PowerAndPanelGIFFORSTEAM.gif?t=1745532073\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Keep a good balance on your way!</strong> <br>  <br> <img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915860/extras/BalanceGIFForSteam.gif?t=1745532073\" />  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Escape...</strong>  <br>  <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915860/extras/V1ChaseGIFFORSTEAM.gif?t=1745532073\" />   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Most importantly! Prevent the place from being wiped off the map! </strong>   <br><strong>Good Luck, 1306!</strong></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2915860?t=1745532073","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915860/6a6ba174eecdf53663020584ecc0f0e7e4d0bf4f/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1745532073","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915860/5807a561255c09f57c1e0503249b6f32f099f11c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745532073","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915860/5807a561255c09f57c1e0503249b6f32f099f11c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1745532073","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Features robotic and organic violence in some cutscenes"},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">1306 is a third-person story game where you play as a reactor maintenance bot labeled 1306, tasked with keeping the power plant from exploding. In this beginning chapter, it's up to 1306 to fix the reactor and prevent a total meltdown! However, they quickly learn that the task is more of a challenge than they initially thought... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2915860/extras/1306Waving.gif?t=1745532073\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The reactor is somehow drained and missing all three coolant rods